ted in the provision."}, {"evidence": [{"doc": "VOL-I", "kind": "span", "page": 3, "unit_id": "VOL-I:6.7", "words": "A Bidder may withdraw or modify its Proposal at any time before the Proposal Due Date by written notice through the Portal."}, {"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 1, "unit_id": "ADD-03:2.1", "words": "may modify its Proposal not later than two (2) Working Days before the Proposal Due Date"}], "id": "S2", "kind": "fact", "text": "At ADD-02, VOL-I:6.7 allows modification at any time before the Proposal Due Date; the new Clause 6.6 allows modification only up to two Working Days before the Proposal Due Date."}, {"evidence": [{"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 1, "unit_id": "ADD-03:cover/para3", "words": "This Addendum consolidates Volume I Clauses 6.6 and 6.7 without change of substance"}], "id": "S3", "kind": "fact", "text": "The cover of ADD-03 describes the consolidation as 'without change of substance'."}, {"id": "S4", "kind": "interpretation", "text": "The cover's 'without change of substance' does not match the operative text of ADD-03:2.1, which moves the modification cut-off from the Proposal Due Date to two Working Days before it. The operative clause 2.1 is applied as printed; the mismatch is raised as an issue for a person."}, {"evidence": [{"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 1, "unit_id": "ADD-03:2.2", "words": "The number 6.7 is not reused. The Clauses of Volume I are not renumbered."}], "id": "S5", "kind": "fact", "text": "ADD-03:2.2 states that number 6.7 is not reused and Volume I is not renumbered."}, {"evidence": [{"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 1, "unit_id": "ADD-03:cover/para3", "words": "Bidders shall acknowledge receipt in Form 4-A."}], "id": "S6", "kind": "fact", "text": "The ADD-03 cover requires Bidders to acknowledge receipt in Form 4-A; ADD-02's identical sentence was handled by an annotate op on its own cover paragraph."}]}, "run_id": "ADD-03-host-20261005T131242Z-7984", "ts": "2026-10-05T13:12:42Z"}
